{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31051","headline":"留题汾上旧居 · 薛能","name":"留题汾上旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡园一别五年归，回首人间总祸机。\n尚胜邻翁常寂寞，敢嫌裘马未轻肥。\n尘颜不见应消落，庭树曾栽已合围。\n难说累牵还却去，可怜榆柳尚依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}